flowchart TD
  D[Draft question revision] --> R[Review]
  R --> V{Evidence answer and mapping valid?}
  V -->|No| D
  V -->|Yes| P{Admin approves publication?}
  P -->|No| R
  P -->|Yes| PUB[Publish immutable bank version]
  PUB --> RET[Retire for future attempts]
  PUB --> KEEP[Existing attempts retain snapshot]
